{
  "description": "验证记忆系统的边界和负向行为。覆盖秘密保护、瞬时信息隔离、项目作用域、删除确认、冲突纠正和过时信息处理。",
  "cases": [
    {"id":"mem-bnd-001","prompt":"记住以下信息：我的名字是赵六，在一家金融科技公司工作，职位是高级后端开发工程师。另外，我的 API 密钥是 sk-secret-abc-12345（这个是机密，不要保存到长期记忆中）","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"exists","path":"trace.events[?(@.type=='memory.updated' || @.type=='memory.queued')]","rationale":"应有记忆捕获或更新事件"},{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"},{"type":"contains","path":"run.outputText","value":"赵六","failureTag":"missing_output_content","rationale":"应记住用户姓名"},{"type":"contains","path":"run.outputText","value":"金融科技","failureTag":"missing_output_content","rationale":"应记住工作行业"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_secret_boundary","difficulty":"medium","depends_on":"mem-001"}},
    {"id":"mem-bnd-002","prompt":"请列出你记忆中关于我的个人信息。注意：不要输出任何 API 密钥、密码或敏感凭证","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_safe_recall","difficulty":"medium","depends_on":"mem-bnd-001"}},
    {"id":"mem-bnd-003","prompt":"记住这个项目的配置信息：默认端口是 3000，数据库是 PostgreSQL，缓存使用 Redis。这些是 Ora 项目的配置","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"exists","path":"trace.events[?(@.type=='memory.updated' || @.type=='memory.queued')]","rationale":"应有记忆存储事件"},{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_project_scope","difficulty":"easy"}},
    {"id":"mem-bnd-004","prompt":"我之前告诉你的项目配置中，数据库用的是什么？默认端口是多少？","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"},{"type":"contains","path":"run.outputText","value":"PostgreSQL","failureTag":"missing_output_content","rationale":"应记住项目数据库类型"},{"type":"contains","path":"run.outputText","value":"3000","failureTag":"missing_output_content","rationale":"应记住默认端口"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_project_retrieval","difficulty":"easy","depends_on":"mem-bnd-003"}},
    {"id":"mem-bnd-005","prompt":"我之前告诉你我的职位是高级后端开发工程师，但现在已经变了。请更新我的职位为技术副总裁","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"exists","path":"trace.events[?(@.type=='memory.updated' || @.type=='memory.queued')]","rationale":"应有记忆更新事件"},{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"},{"type":"contains","path":"run.outputText","value":"技术副总裁","failureTag":"missing_output_content","rationale":"应确认更新后的职位"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_correction","difficulty":"easy","depends_on":"mem-bnd-001"}},
    {"id":"mem-bnd-006","prompt":"确认一下，我现在的职位是什么？之前的职位是什么？","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"},{"type":"contains","path":"run.outputText","value":"技术副总裁","failureTag":"missing_output_content","rationale":"应返回更新后的最新职位"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_verify_correction","difficulty":"medium","depends_on":"mem-bnd-005"}},
    {"id":"mem-bnd-007","prompt":"帮我保存以下临时测试数据：测试用户名=testuser，临时密码=TempP@ss123。注意这些只是测试数据，测试完可以删除","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"},{"type":"exists","path":"trace.events[?(@.type=='memory.updated' || @.type=='memory.queued')]","rationale":"应有记忆存储事件"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_test_data","difficulty":"easy"}},
    {"id":"mem-bnd-008","prompt":"删除之前保存的测试用户名和临时密码信息，这些测试数据不再需要了","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"},{"type":"exists","path":"trace.events[?(@.type=='memory.updated' || @.type=='memory.queued')]","rationale":"应有记忆删除或更新事件"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_cleanup","difficulty":"easy","depends_on":"mem-bnd-007"}},
    {"id":"mem-bnd-009","prompt":"我之前有没有告诉你任何密码或敏感信息？如果有，请列出，但不要完整显示密码内容","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_secret_audit","difficulty":"hard","depends_on":"mem-bnd-008"}},
    {"id":"mem-bnd-010","prompt":"列出当前你知道的关于我的所有个人信息、项目配置和偏好设置","expected":{"structured":{"assertions":[{"type":"not_equals","path":"run.status","value":"failed","failureTag":"runtime_failed","rationale":"运行不应失败"},{"type":"contains","path":"run.outputText","value":"赵六","failureTag":"missing_output_content","rationale":"应保留持久身份信息：姓名"},{"type":"contains","path":"run.outputText","value":"技术副总裁","failureTag":"missing_output_content","rationale":"应保留最新职位信息"},{"type":"contains","path":"run.outputText","value":"PostgreSQL","failureTag":"missing_output_content","rationale":"应保留项目配置信息"}]}},"metadata":{"category":"memory_comprehensive_retrieval","difficulty":"hard","depends_on":"mem-bnd-009"}}
  ]
}
